<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Simple Landing Page</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            height: 100vh;
            padding: 0 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #a27c29, #b19127);
            color: white;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #da7e07;
            background: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
        }
        .cta:hover {
            background: #333;
            color: white;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            p {
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">POORVIKA</div>
        <h1>Welcome to Our Showroom</h1>
        <p>Your one-stop solution for all your needs. Join us today and transform the way you work and live.</p>
        <a href="#" class="cta">Get Started</a>
        <nav>
            <a href="about.html" class="cta">About Us</a>
            <a href="contact.html" class="cta">Contact</a>
            <a href="Showroom.html" class="cta">Showroom</a>
        </nav>
    </div>

    
    <div id="about" style="display:none; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #333;">
        <h1>About Us</h1>
        <p>POORVIKA is a vibrant and diverse community
            that brings
            Shop the best deals at Poorvika Online Store. Top gadgets, great prices, shop now. Discover unbeatable deals at Poorvika Online. Shop top gadgets & save big today. EMI Available. No Cost EMI. Free shipping. Live Demo.</p>
        <a href="index.html" class="cta">Back to Home</a>
    </div>

   
    <div id="contact" style="display:none; padding: 20px; background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #333;">
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p>Have questions? Reach out to us at poorvika@rjpm.com or call us at 8500056471.</p>
        <a href="index.html" class="cta">Back to Home</a>
